Package: graph
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: willgcr <hello@willgcr.me>
Depends: libc6
Recommends: libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Suggests: samba, samba-vfs-modules, cifs-utils
Homepage: https://wrklabs.org/graph
Description: personal knowledge hub
 graph turns an ordinary directory into a repository for the things you
 keep — people, organizations, finances, research, notes, media, whatever
 accumulates — shows it as one connected whole, and shares it over SMB so
 every machine you own can reach it. The repository stays a plain
 directory tree, readable and editable with the tools already on the
 system.
 .
 graph display opens a local view of a repository in a small native
 window (WebKitGTK, recommended) or, without it, in the browser.
